-	// See: TaperedCapsuleShape.gliffy
-	// We need to calculate ty and by in order to see if the position is on the top or bottom sphere
-	// sin(alpha) = by / br = ty / tr
-	// => by = sin(alpha) * br, ty = sin(alpha) * tr
