-					_     /  cylinder   \
-					 --_ /               \
-						b-----------------+
-					 D  |        E        |
-						|                 |
-
-					t = side_support_top, b = side_support_bottom
-					Lines between B and C and C and D are at a 90 degree angle to the line between t and b
